rom resource limitations or the pressure of time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a vibrant art style and calming soundtrack, as you restore serenity to a world in need of hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out greater heights with previously released DLC content including New Game Plus and a Hard Mode</p></li></ul>",
